**/*.proptest-regressions

# Vendored, pinned seLe4n ABI mirror (D8, GPL-3.0-or-later): the SOURCE is committed
# under vendor/sele4n/ (separately licensed; see NOTICE §2/§4). Ignore only its build
# artifacts and standalone lockfile (the root Cargo.lock governs the real-abi build).
/vendor/sele4n/target
/vendor/sele4n/Cargo.lock

# mdbook
/docs/book

